You are designing high-fidelity mockups for TWBIS (Tourism Web-Based 
Information System), the official tourism website of Calabanga, 
Camarines Sur, Philippines.

This is a PUBLIC-FACING tourist website only. Do not include any admin 
panels, CMS dashboards, or staff-facing screens.

---

BRAND IDENTITY & DESIGN LANGUAGE:

This website should feel like a premium Philippine regional tourism brand — 
warm, welcoming, culturally rooted, and trustworthy as an LGU platform. 
It should NOT feel like a generic government portal. Think DOT Philippines 
quality but localized to Calabanga's identity: coastal, river, agricultural, 
with a strong OTOP craft culture.

COLOR SYSTEM:
Primary: #1B4332 (deep Bicol forest green — evokes Mayon's slopes and rice fields)
Primary light: #D8F3DC (soft mint — hover states, section backgrounds)
Accent: #B5451B (terra cotta/burnt sienna — evokes Bicolano pottery, volcanic earth)
Accent light: #FFE8DE (warm peach — badge backgrounds, tag fills)
Gold highlight: #D4AC0D (used sparingly — accreditation badges, star ratings only)
Neutral dark: #1A1A1A
Neutral mid: #5C5C5C
Neutral light: #F2F0EB (warm off-white — page background, NOT pure white)
White: #FFFFFF (card surfaces only)
Danger: #C0392B
Success: #1B7A4A

TYPOGRAPHY:
- Display headings (H1): "Plus Jakarta Sans" Bold 700 — for hero titles and page H1
- Section headings (H2, H3): "Plus Jakarta Sans" SemiBold 600
- Body text: "Inter" Regular 400 — clean readability for descriptions
- Captions, badges, labels: "Inter" Medium 500, uppercase tracking 0.05em
- Fallback stack: system-ui, sans-serif
- Minimum body font size: 16px
- Line height: 1.6 for body, 1.2 for headings

SPACING SYSTEM: 8px base grid
4px | 8px | 12px | 16px | 24px | 32px | 48px | 64px | 96px | 128px

BORDER RADIUS:
- Buttons: 8px
- Cards: 12px
- Badges/pills: 999px (full round)
- Map info cards: 12px
- Modal: 16px

ELEVATION (flat design — use borders not shadows):
- Default card: 1px border #E8E4DC
- Hover card: 1px border #1B4332 (primary)
- Active/selected: 2px border #1B4332
- No box-shadow anywhere except 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08) on the fixed navbar

---

COMPONENT LIBRARY (define these first, use everywhere):

1. Primary button
- Background: #1B4332 | Text: #FFFFFF | Height: 48px | Padding: 0 24px | Radius: 8px
- Hover: #14532D | Active: scale(0.98) | Disabled: 40% opacity
- Icon-left variant: 20px icon + 8px gap + label

2. Ghost button  
- Border: 1.5px solid #1B4332 | Text: #1B4332 | Same sizing as primary
- Hover: background #D8F3DC

3. Accreditation badge
- Shape: pill with left gold dot (6px circle #D4AC0D) + "LGU Accredited" text
- Background: #FFF9E6 | Text: #7D5A00 | Border: 1px solid #D4AC0D
- Size: 12px text, 24px height

4. Category badge/pill
- Background: accent light #FFE8DE | Text: #7A2D0E | Border: none
- Size: 12px text, 22px height, 999px radius

5. Product card
- White card, 12px radius, 1px border #E8E4DC
- Image: 4:3 ratio, 12px top radius (clipped to card), overflow hidden
- Accreditation badge: top-right absolute, 8px from edges
- Product name: H3 16px Plus Jakarta Sans SemiBold, 2-line clamp
- Producer name: 13px Inter, color #5C5C5C, with verified check icon in #1B7A4A
- Price: 15px Inter Medium, #1A1A1A
- Bottom: "View product →" in #1B4332, 13px
- Hover state: border becomes #1B4332, card lifts (translate Y -2px)

6. Map pin markers
- Default: teardrop shape, fill #1B4332, white icon inside (matching category)
- Selected: larger scale (1.3x), fill #B5451B
- Cluster: circle, fill #1B4332, white number inside, 44px diameter
- Category-coded: Nature = #1B7A4A | Beach = #1565C0 | Food = #B5451B | Cultural = #7B341E

7. Location info card (map popup)
- White card 280px wide, 12px radius, 1px border #E8E4DC
- Thumbnail: 280×140px, 12px top radius
- Name: 15px SemiBold | Category badge | Distance text | Stars | "View details →" CTA
- Subtle entrance animation: fade + translateY(8px)

8. Skeleton loading state
- Use #E8E4DC fills for image placeholders
- Use #F2F0EB for text line placeholders (varying widths: 100%, 80%, 60%)
- Pulse animation: opacity 1 → 0.5 → 1, 1.4s ease-in-out infinite
- Apply to: product cards, event cards, location info cards

9. Empty state
- Centered illustration area: 160×160px placeholder box with dashed #BDBDBD border
- H3 "No results found" | Body "Try adjusting your search or filters" | "Clear filters" ghost button

10. Toast notification
- Fixed bottom-right, 320px wide, 12px radius
- Success: left 4px border #1B7A4A, background white, green check icon
- Error: left 4px border #C0392B, background white, red X icon
- Auto-dismiss: 4 seconds

---

NAVIGATION (apply to all pages):

Desktop navbar (64px height, white background, bottom border 1px #E8E4DC):
- Left: Logo — text "TWBIS" in Plus Jakarta Sans Bold 20px #1B4332 + tagline "Calabanga Tourism" in 12px #5C5C5C
- Center: Nav links — Home | Discover | Map | OTOP | Events | Museum (15px Inter Medium, #1A1A1A, active = #1B4332 + 2px underline)
- Right: Search icon (20px) | "Login" ghost button (small, 36px height)
- Scrolled state: add box-shadow 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)

Mobile navbar (56px height):
- Left: Logo | Right: Search icon + Hamburger icon
- Drawer: full-screen overlay, white, all nav links stacked vertically with 48px touch targets

